cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: AtmoResponse
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python tools for tracing atmospheric-correction uncertainty into
  Tanager and EMIT reflectance algorithms. AtmoResponse re-corrects a delivered
  scene at an alternative aerosol optical depth and measures how far a reflectance
  algorithm's output moves.
type: software
authors:
